    <string name="privacy_body">You can watch without an account. If you sign in, Zenvu stores your email and the channels you save in Firebase so favorites follow the account. Theme and the last country stay on this device.\n\nDelete the account in Settings. That removes the Firebase user and the saved favorites. You can also open the deletion page: https://valijonzoda.github.io/Zenvu/delete-account/\n\nThe app downloads channel lists from GitHub (the public Famelack dataset). GitHub can see the network address of that request. When you press play, this device connects directly to the stream operator or, for embedded webcams, to YouTube. Those services receive the usual technical data a player sends, including your IP address.\n\nSome listings are marked region locked. A stream can also fail because it is offline or uses a format this device cannot play.\n\nClear saved listings in Settings to delete the downloaded catalog. Uninstalling the app removes on-device settings. Favorites stored in an account stay until you delete the account.\n\nZenvu is an independent directory. It is not the official Famelack app and it is not operated by the channels, stations, or webcam owners.</string>
